{
    "title": "Bible Trivia Game: Heroes",
    "description": "Learn about the Bible and enhance your biblical knowledge with Heroes: The Bible Trivia Game!\r\n\r\nThis is the best Bible trivia game\u2014in the style of Bible Trivia, and the best part is that this Bible game is completely free and ad-free!\r\n\r\nEarn points every time you answer a question correctly. The more points you have, the more heroes and effects you will be able to unlock.\r\n\r\nNot sure about the answer? Don't worry, Heroes is ready to give you a push. To find the answer in the Bible, use the Daniel Effect; to remove wrong answers, apply the Abraham Effect; to skip a question, the Jonah Effect is the perfect choice; and if you want to know the correct answer, the Jesus Effect shows you the way.\r\n\r\nChallenge yourself in this Bible quiz game. As you progress in the game, the number of questions increases, and so does the difficulty level.\r\n\r\nStart your journey in the book of Genesis, answering biblical questions about the story of Adam and Eve, and you advance with heroes from the Old and New Testaments, such as Joseph, David, Daniel, Esther, Mary, Jesus, Peter.\r\n\r\nCHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS! With Heroes, you can challenge your family and friends by sharing a simple link. Challenge your pastor, priest, or youth leader. Show that you are Bible smart!\r\n\r\nHeroes: The Bible Trivia Game is completely free because we want more people to learn about the Bible. If you enjoyed it, please rate the game with 5 stars and leave a comment. This is very important to us, and we would be happy to hear your opinion.\r\n\r\nDo you have any questions or suggestions? Contact us, and we will do our best to help:\r\n\r\nhttps://www.heroesbibletrivia.org/en\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/heroesbibletrivia\r\nhttps://discord.gg/R62BpsKxsV\r\n\r\nLearning about the Bible can be much more fun with this amazing Bible game. Heroes is an interactive Bible quiz game with thousands of Bible questions and answers, made for all ages.\r\n\r\nDownload Heroes now and increase your biblical knowledge! Play and share it too!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Learn about the Bible and enhance your biblical knowledge with Heroes: The Bible Trivia Game!<br><br>This is the best Bible trivia game\u2014in the style of Bible Trivia, and the best part is that this Bible game is completely free and ad-free!<br><br>Earn points every time you answer a question correctly. The more points you have, the more heroes and effects you will be able to unlock.<br><br>Not sure about the answer? Don&#39;t worry, Heroes is ready to give you a push. To find the answer in the Bible, use the Daniel Effect; to remove wrong answers, apply the Abraham Effect; to skip a question, the Jonah Effect is the perfect choice; and if you want to know the correct answer, the Jesus Effect shows you the way.<br><br>Challenge yourself in this Bible quiz game. As you progress in the game, the number of questions increases, and so does the difficulty level.<br><br>Start your journey in the book of Genesis, answering biblical questions about the story of Adam and Eve, and you advance with heroes from the Old and New Testaments, such as Joseph, David, Daniel, Esther, Mary, Jesus, Peter.<br><br>CHALLENGE YOUR FRIENDS! With Heroes, you can challenge your family and friends by sharing a simple link. Challenge your pastor, priest, or youth leader. Show that you are Bible smart!<br><br>Heroes: The Bible Trivia Game is completely free because we want more people to learn about the Bible. If you enjoyed it, please rate the game with 5 stars and leave a comment. This is very important to us, and we would be happy to hear your opinion.<br><br>Do you have any questions or suggestions? Contact us, and we will do our best to help:<br><br>https://www.heroesbibletrivia.org/en<br>https://www.instagram.com/heroesbibletrivia<br>https://discord.gg/R62BpsKxsV<br><br>Learning about the Bible can be much more fun with this amazing Bible game. Heroes is an interactive Bible quiz game with thousands of Bible questions and answers, made for all ages.<br><br>Download Heroes now and increase your biblical knowledge! Play and share it too!",
